<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31302" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσαφ-ικνέομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσαπικνέομαι</span></b> ,
			2sg.
		aor.
		subj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσαφίκηαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					170
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>come into</i> or <i>to, arrive at,</i> c.
			acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴλιον εἰσαφικέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.17
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συβώτην εἰ.</span>
			<i>go into</i> his house, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.404
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σειρῆνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					861
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥς τινα εἰ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.45
				</span></i>
			 : c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ τε ἄλλῃ</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρῃ</span>) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ δὴ καὶ ἐς τὸ Ἄργος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήμη ἐς. τοῖσι Ἕλλησι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.100
				</span></i>
			 : abs., <i>arrive,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				101
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ εἰσαφικνούμενοι</span>
			<i>visitors</i> to a country, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Men.</u>
				92b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1191.17
			</span></i> : c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφιστοῦ</span> (nisi
			leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;ἐσ&gt;</span>) <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				19.3
			</span></i>.</div>
